ringdown-data.js: generated by tasks/t04-ringdown/make_ringdown_data.py from the NR run
prod_n24 (Einstein Toolkit, GW150914-like binary; puncture tracks, apparent-horizon radii,
psi4 l=2 m=2 at r = 100 M). Do not edit by hand.

eht_m87_800.jpg: the Event Horizon Telescope image of M87* (EHT Collaboration 2019),
ESO release eso1907a, https://www.eso.org/public/images/eso1907a/, licence CC BY 4.0
(credit: EHT Collaboration). Cropped to the central 2800x2800 px and resized to 800x800.

ringdown-title-data.js: generated by tasks/t04-ringdown/make_title_wave.py from SXS:BBH:0305
(Lev6, cached SXS catalog; Boyle et al. 2019, arXiv:1904.04831): Re h22 from two cycles
before the peak of |h22| to 60 M_f after it. Do not edit by hand.
